      "summaries": {
        "en": "Oh-my-claudecode is a multi-agent orchestration framework designed to enhance collaborative AI coding workflows using Claude Code. It enables parallel execution of specialized coding agents that can tackle different aspects of software development simultaneously, improving efficiency through coordinated task distribution. Developers can implement this system to automate complex coding pipelines, experiment with agent specialization strategies, or build custom workflows that leverage multiple AI models working in concert on software projects.",
        "zh": "Oh-my-claudecode是专为Claude Code设计的团队协作多智能体框架，旨在提升AI编程效率。它通过并行执行多个专业化代理，同时处理代码生成、测试与优化等任务，实现自动化分工协作。框架将复杂任务分解为可并行子任务，并通过协调机制确保代码一致性，支持构建自动化流水线、实验分工策略及定制工作流，以探索多智能体协同编程的实际应用。",
        "es": "Oh-my-claudecode is a multi-agent orchestration framework designed to enhance collaborative AI coding workflows using Claude Code. It enables parallel execution of specialized coding agents that can tackle different aspects of software development simultaneously, improving efficiency through coordinated task distribution. Developers can implement this system to automate complex coding pipelines, experiment with agent specialization strategies, or build custom workflows that leverage multiple AI models working in concert on software projects.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "oh-my-claudecode stands out for agentic-coding, ai-agents, and automation in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Oh-my-claudecode is a multi-agent orchestration framework designed to enhance collaborative AI coding workflows using Claude Code. It enables parallel execution of specialized coding agents that can tackle different aspects of software development simultaneously, improving efficiency through coordinated task distribution. Developers can implement this system to automate complex coding pipelines, experiment with agent specialization strategies, or build custom workflows that leverage multiple AI models working in concert on software projects.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/Yeachan-Heo/oh-my-claudecode for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
